      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you run around with high safety and wanna see stuff, you can just use Show Avatar on that person and then you'll see his everything.\n\nThe reason I would want that is so that I can turn off certain features on a specific user without hiding the entire avatar, which would prevent me from seeing what they are or if they've switched to something else.\n\nHide avatar also disables hand movement. Not very ideal if I just want to get rid of someone's particles or shaders.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
