      "mergeID": "605cdfaec98ec12182b6f17b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "add the option to enable specific safety options to specific users (for example: disable only avatar sounds/enable only animations to only one user)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Being able to change safety avatar options to specific users",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5c33973265975519a762c394",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Welcome to the highly requested but not yet implemented club.  \nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/adjust-safety-settings-for-individuals\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/safety-settings\nThere is a list of things that would have been better implemented with separation for more control.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/separate-friends-from-minimum-displayed-performance-rank\nIn addition things like the safety and performance settings should also be separate disable toggles rather than a single show all button.\nIts a bit hard for me to find my older upvoted or request canny posts from when the google accounts were a thing so I don't currently have a full list of all the separation requests seeing as they were almost a year ago.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
